OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer who raped two women
OL,4,Ajailed for 12 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former police sergeant who was found
OL,7,Fguilty of a catalogue of sex crimes,
OL,8,Fincluding raping two women, has been
OL,9,Fjailed for 12 years.
OL,11,FCampbell Petrie had been convicted of
OL,12,Feight charges involving physical and
OL,13,Fsexual abuse towards the women in
OL,14,FGlasgow over a 17-year period between
OL,15,F2006 and 2023.
OL,17,FPetrie, who had denied the allegations,
OL,18,Fwill be supervised and monitored in the
OL,19,Fcommunity for a further three years
OL,20,Fafter his release.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
